1
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:10,117
Welcome to Rover Trading, the academy where you learn to read the market, one candle at a time.

2
00:00:10,117 --> 00:00:18,100
In this walkthrough, we'll tour every page: the landing page, student sign-up, the member dashboard, and the admin portal.

3
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:29,974
Below the hero, the About section lays out the teaching philosophy: understand the market, learn through practice, and build discipline before taking on real risk.

4
00:00:29,974 --> 00:00:41,220
From there, the curriculum unfolds across three chapters - market foundations, advanced market analysis, and trading psychology - each followed by a guided live practice week.

5
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:50,439
Between chapters sits the academy's book edition, Read the Market like a Rover, by Lethabo Loate.

6
00:00:50,439 --> 00:00:58,903
Then comes course investment: Standard at R150, Premium at R400, and Rover Signals, which is coming soon.

7
00:00:58,903 --> 00:01:03,740
Every application is processed inside the student dashboard.

8
00:01:05,140 --> 00:01:14,259
The weekly timetable lists the Sunday pre-class briefing on Zoom, along with each chapter's session times, so students always know when to log in.

9
00:01:14,259 --> 00:01:21,380
Below that, a live average rating is calculated from verified student reviews, and graduates can submit their own.

10
00:01:22,780 --> 00:01:29,800
The terms and conditions section answers the practical questions: attendance, course rules, and risk disclaimers.

11
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:39,740
Contact cards for Instagram, TikTok, and WhatsApp follow, and the page closes with a call to action that sends visitors to create a student account, or sign in.

12
00:01:41,140 --> 00:01:51,820
New students start on the sign-up page, where the form captures their details, shows a live password strength meter, and automatically generates an RT account number.

13
00:01:53,220 --> 00:02:03,260
Returning students use the login screen, which offers quick-fill buttons for the demo student and admin accounts, a password visibility toggle, and Google sign-in.

14
00:02:04,660 --> 00:02:11,982
Signing in lands on the student dashboard: your account number, enrollment status, and three clear next steps.

15
00:02:11,982 --> 00:02:21,300
Each tab handles one job, from applications and enquiries, through to banking details and proof of payment, and finally the learners portal.

16
00:02:22,700 --> 00:02:25,650
Administrators get a dedicated operations portal.

17
00:02:25,650 --> 00:02:32,213
Submitted proofs of payment are reviewed and approved, which unlocks a student's learners portal immediately.

18
00:02:32,213 --> 00:02:40,100
Admins can also manage curriculum documents, update Zoom meeting links, monitor student progress, and browse the members directory.

19
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:48,941
That's the full walk around of Rover Trading: one connected platform, from first click to graduation.

20
00:02:48,941 --> 00:02:51,740
Read the market, one candle at a time.
